{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1cf969b7ed90047ea3ba23bfffd1ff959acec6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" /> are real numbers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/a/a6a8d553d3cb6b0489835b3218e7aa4c463eef70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} x&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"86\" height=\"19\" />, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/4/a6492bb82cad8dc54ea92dc13be46f2a14f7579a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ x&lt;0 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -1&lt;x&lt;1 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 0&lt;x\\le 1 \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ -1&lt;x&lt;0 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 0&lt;x&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/6/de695740d4df1feafc2c2a74190ce93ceb6d204e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10} x = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/8/3a87df37ab18de5935e0bd19a34845e606e07074.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^a = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />.  Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/0/5c041fca222a8c4acc1639c8c97a3bb290ab099e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^0 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/8/f78b626e29df06e5c296ebb7218f07562833b276.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"25\" height=\"13\" /> increases as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> increases.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/1/c319a78bbce71ba12b4ccb52f0b0b793ef760f58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ecb131995929813ac302d0b3fab935146a635bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^a &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />.  However, for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/a/4ba16cba0b4b18bede061cf4e6bbbaf14cdd2580.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^a &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/f/e4f17e1346c7c9bb4f51a1dc76b4e547a9da487c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; x &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />.  The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•<